# TypeScript's incremental-build bookkeeping — if copied stale from the host
# (this repo's own dev environment builds these constantly), tsc's
# incremental check compares only source file state, not whether the dist/
# it references still exists, and silently skips emitting entirely,
# producing a "successful" build with no output (found the hard way while
# verifying this Dockerfile — F-06).
